description: Brevo, formerly Sendinblue, is a cloud-based software company that provides tools for marketing and relationship marketing. The company offers a cloud-based marketing communication software suite with email marketing, transactional email, marketing automation, customer-relationship management, landing pages, Facebook ads, retargeting ads, SMS marketing, SMS messaging and customer relationship management (CRM), and Customer Data Platform (CDP).
